Yeah. Cubby, I can fight.


00:39:47.151 --> 00:39:48.685
I can be somebody.


00:39:48.686 --> 00:39:52.422
Go be somebody with somebody
else, and let me be. Huh?


00:39:52.423 --> 00:39:54.102
You know I can fight.


00:39:54.425 --> 00:39:57.037
I don't know if you have
the heart or the head.


00:39:58.028 --> 00:40:00.296
Just give me a shot.


00:40:00.297 --> 00:40:02.272
You had your shot!


00:40:03.334 --> 00:40:05.639
You know what you did before, huh?


00:40:10.007 --> 00:40:13.410
I'm sorry about before.
I know I disappointed you.


00:40:13.411 --> 00:40:16.888
- I... I didn't know better.
- You got that right.


00:40:18.182 --> 00:40:20.384
Can you please just give me
another chance?


00:40:21.652 --> 00:40:23.160
Hey!


00:40:24.021 --> 00:40:27.157
You watch your stance, huh?
You gotta put your left...


00:40:27.158 --> 00:40:29.392
I told you not to be so wide, huh?


00:40:29.393 --> 00:40:31.461
Close up your stance,
and you keep your left


00:40:31.462 --> 00:40:33.232
in his face, huh?


00:40:34.365 --> 00:40:35.600
Hey, kid!


00:40:36.133 --> 00:40:37.869
King!


00:40:47.845 --> 00:40:50.685
You are not going to flake out
on me this time, are you?


00:40:51.115 --> 00:40:52.555
Hm?


00:40:52.716 --> 00:40:56.659
- No.
- Are you gonna stick to it? Train?


00:40:57.221 --> 00:40:58.855
Come to the gym on time?


00:40:58.856 --> 00:41:01.391
Yeah, I promise. You know...
You know I got talent.


00:41:01.392 --> 00:41:04.095
Yeah, but are you willing
to put in the hard yards?


00:41:06.230 --> 00:41:09.132
Give me a fight, you'll see.


00:41:09.133 --> 00:41:10.744
Hey.


00:41:12.069 --> 00:41:15.341
If you fail me this time...
Hey, look at me.


00:41:16.507 --> 00:41:19.075
If you fail me this
time, it's over.


00:41:19.076 --> 00:41:21.222
Huh? You got it?


00:41:22.079 --> 00:41:24.520
- I got it.
- All right.


00:41:25.316 --> 00:41:30.431
Now, this is against my better
judgment, but I will give you a fight.


00:41:31.889 --> 00:41:33.363
All right?


00:41:38.262 --> 00:41:39.696
Thanks, Cubby.


00:41:39.697 --> 00:41:41.564
It won't be much.


00:41:41.565 --> 00:41:43.870
That's okay, I just...


00:41:44.935 --> 00:41:48.207
I just need something
to get me going again.


00:41:50.574 --> 00:41:52.651
Let's go, box!


00:41:55.412 --> 00:41:57.148
Use your jab!


00:42:06.557 --> 00:42:08.758
Get those hands low,
Sailor, let's go.


00:42:08.759 --> 00:42:10.131
Break it up!


00:42:10.794 --> 00:42:13.329
Take the old man out, King!


00:42:13.330 --> 00:42:15.271
Put him in the hospital, King!


00:42:24.041 --> 00:42:28.177
Head butt, really? That's how you gonna
fight? Huh? Huh? You ain't know how to box!


00:42:28.178 --> 00:42:31.214
- You're a boxer, let's go.
- This is dirty boxing.


00:42:31.215 --> 00:42:34.419
- Get to your corners.
- I apologize.


00:42:35.586 --> 00:42:38.054
Let me see your head.
Let me see your head!


00:42:38.055 --> 00:42:40.223
All right. All right.


00:42:40.224 --> 00:42:42.292
You know Sailor's got
a fight coming up.


00:42:42.293 --> 00:42:44.473
Yeah, yeah, I know.


00:42:45.996 --> 00:42:47.530
He can't do it.


00:42:47.531 --> 00:42:52.302
No. But I'll bet you're gonna
be in his corner though, right?


00:42:52.303 --> 00:42:54.237
What am I gonna do? It's Sailor.


00:42:54.238 --> 00:42:57.317
"What am I gonna do?" I mean,
you could try talking to him.


00:42:58.075 --> 00:43:00.778
- Did you?
- Yes, I did.


00:43:02.379 --> 00:43:04.525
You know what this is all about.


00:43:05.649 --> 00:43:07.851
Well, I don't know.
He told me he missed it.


00:43:08.052 --> 00:43:12.355
Yeah, well, that's all well and
good, but it's his mother.


00:43:12.356 --> 00:43:14.126
His mom's dying.


00:43:15.459 --> 00:43:17.138
Huh.


00:43:18.796 --> 00:43:20.873
That's kind of
inconvenient for her.


00:43:21.665 --> 00:43:26.102
Rose wants to visit the old
country again before she passes.


00:43:26.103 --> 00:43:29.750
He gets 4 grand, even if he loses.


00:43:30.174 --> 00:43:33.409
Yeah, but, I mean, you and I could
put up that money for him, and...


00:43:33.410 --> 00:43:35.749
- He wouldn't take it.
- You tried already?


00:43:35.779 --> 00:43:36.980
I offered him money.


00:43:36.981 --> 00:43:40.216
I said, "All you gotta do, come by
the shop a couple times a week.


00:43:40.217 --> 00:43:44.559
Tell stories to the guys." And he
goes, "No, I don't take handouts."


00:43:49.727 --> 00:43:52.228
Are you a religious man?


00:43:52.229 --> 00:43:53.830
Why do you ask?


00:43:53.831 --> 00:43:58.173
Oh, just to see if you reside in
that papas camp of blind obedience.


00:44:01.071 --> 00:44:05.074
Well, no, no, I'm not
especially religious.


00:44:05.075 --> 00:44:07.010
But they call you Brother Albright.


00:44:07.011 --> 00:44:09.145
Ah, yeah, well...


00:44:09.146 --> 00:44:12.215
That's down at the harbor,
it's more of a term of affection.


00:44:12.216 --> 00:44:15.685
You know? "Hey, brother, hey,
bro." You know, that's all.


00:44:15.686 --> 00:44:17.263
What do you do down there?


00:44:17.988 --> 00:44:22.291
We're just a group of
people that do service.


00:44:22.292 --> 00:44:23.593
Service?


00:44:23.594 --> 00:44:26.468
Service, you know,
helping others in need.


00:44:27.731 --> 00:44:30.207
- Well, that's much better than religion.
- Yes.


00:44:34.104 --> 00:44:37.478
Ahem. You know that,
um... Yeah, thanks.


00:44:37.808 --> 00:44:40.343
...Sailor has another
fight lined up.


00:44:40.344 --> 00:44:41.711
I know.


00:44:41.712 --> 00:44:44.447
And he wants me to
be in the corner.


00:44:44.448 --> 00:44:46.149
He said you couldn't do it.


00:44:46.150 --> 00:44:49.285
Probably more correct is
you don't want to do it.


00:44:49.286 --> 00:44:50.486
That would be correct.


00:44:50.487 --> 00:44:52.922
- You don't want him to fight, do you?
- No, no, no.


00:44:52.923 --> 00:44:55.858
- And I don't suppose you do either.
- No, certainly not.


00:44:55.859 --> 00:44:59.165
God only knows why his
brains aren't scrambled.


00:45:00.964 --> 00:45:03.838
Look, um, Rose, I, uh...


00:45:04.768 --> 00:45:09.505
I hope I'm not talking out of turn
here, but Max told me that the reason


00:45:09.506 --> 00:45:12.475
he's taking the fight is because
he wants to take you to Ireland.


00:45:12.476 --> 00:45:16.488
No need to be delicate. He wants
to take me to Ireland before I die.


00:45:17.147 --> 00:45:18.915
I got it, but...


00:45:18.916 --> 00:45:21.984
see, the thing is that
Max and I could easily,


00:45:21.985 --> 00:45:23.453
easily cover that trip.


00:45:23.454 --> 00:45:26.828
No. Sailor would never
go for it, nor would I.


00:45:27.458 --> 00:45:32.368
But I would appreciate it if you and
Max would be in my boy's corner.


00:45:33.831 --> 00:45:35.476
You gonna be at the fight?


00:45:35.532 --> 00:45:38.542
No. I've never seen one of
Sailor's fights. Never will.


00:45:39.837 --> 00:45:44.440
Sixty-four fights. This
will be his 64th fight.


00:45:44.441 --> 00:45:46.642
My boy has a terrible
record, doesn't he?


00:45:46.643 --> 00:45:48.379
Yes, ma'am, he does. Ha, ha.


00:45:48.645 --> 00:45:51.881
But the man has never been down.
Never.


00:45:51.882 --> 00:45:54.183
But you see, a man should
know when to go down.


00:45:54.184 --> 00:45:56.986
A man should know when to quit.


00:45:56.987 --> 00:46:00.725
Yes, you think he
should. But, your boy...


00:46:02.025 --> 00:46:06.139
I mean, the guy is, um... I just
never seen anything like it.


00:46:06.697 --> 00:46:09.899
I mean, I thought I
was tough, but I'm...


00:46:09.900 --> 00:46:12.101
I'm like Tinker Bell or
something. I mean...


00:46:12.102 --> 00:46:15.538
I mean, I see him
get hit with, uh...


00:46:15.539 --> 00:46:17.874
With hammers, with...
I mean, and...


00:46:17.875 --> 00:46:20.777
It would kill an elephant.
He just will not go down.


00:46:20.778 --> 00:46:23.584
I just don't believe
it and I don't get it.


00:46:25.282 --> 00:46:27.291
Yeah, well...


00:46:29.887 --> 00:46:35.691
When he was a little boy, about 10,


00:46:35.692 --> 00:46:38.227
we were driving in the car.


00:46:38.228 --> 00:46:41.430
<i>His father had been drinking.</i>


00:46:41.431 --> 00:46:44.066
<i>He started hitting me hard.</i>


00:46:44.067 --> 00:46:45.468
Keep my mouth shut?


00:46:45.469 --> 00:46:46.636
Yes, your mouth shut.


00:46:46.637 --> 00:46:48.004
- Our boy's in the back...
- Unh!


00:46:48.005 --> 00:46:49.539
- Dad!
- You think I don't know


00:46:49.540 --> 00:46:51.073
the kid's in the backseat?


00:46:51.074 --> 00:46:53.376
You... You need help.


00:46:53.377 --> 00:46:56.524
You know what I need?
For you to shut up!


00:46:56.747 --> 00:46:58.426
Dad!


00:46:59.249 --> 00:47:00.983
- Get off!
- Sailor.


00:47:00.984 --> 00:47:02.418
Get off!


00:47:02.419 --> 00:47:05.225
<i>His father slammed his head
against the side window</i>


00:47:05.489 --> 00:47:08.329
so hard, it cracked the glass.


00:47:10.127 --> 00:47:12.102
Sailor passed out.


00:47:13.764 --> 00:47:16.566
George hit me some more


00:47:16.567 --> 00:47:19.509
and then he threw us
both out of the car.


00:47:21.939 --> 00:47:25.985
When Sailor came to, we were
at the side of the road.


00:47:26.210 --> 00:47:27.677
It wasn't your fault.


00:47:27.678 --> 00:47:29.412
<i>My face was a mess.</i>


00:47:29.413 --> 00:47:31.247
Are you okay?


00:47:31.248 --> 00:47:35.555
<i>He said he was okay,
but he really wasn't.</i>


00:47:36.787 --> 00:47:39.255
He knocked you out, Sailor.


00:47:39.256 --> 00:47:43.593
<i>Sailor vowed it would
never happen again.</i>


00:47:43.594 --> 00:47:46.775
<i>Maybe that's it. I don't know.</i>


00:47:51.201 --> 00:47:56.077
Or maybe he's just got a stupid
Irish head made of pig iron.


00:47:56.974 --> 00:47:59.780
But my boy's got sand.
That's for sure.


00:48:00.844 --> 00:48:03.081
Yes, he does.


00:48:04.314 --> 00:48:05.959
Um, what happened to your husband?


00:48:06.183 --> 00:48:09.819
I don't know. He left the day it
happened. I never saw him again.


00:48:09.820 --> 00:48:11.254
Never heard from him.


00:48:11.255 --> 00:48:14.527
- Sorry.
- Oh. There's no need to be.


00:48:14.825 --> 00:48:18.336
Please just be in my boy's corner.


00:48:21.398 --> 00:48:25.434
Yes, ma'am. Max and I will be.


00:48:25.435 --> 00:48:28.170
And you tell him when
it's time, you got that?


00:48:28.171 --> 00:48:30.282
You tell him when it's time.


00:48:30.841 --> 00:48:36.684
Because... Well, Sailor
just doesn't know.


00:48:37.414 --> 00:48:39.715
- I'm fine!
- King, let's have a look at that.


00:48:39.716 --> 00:48:41.554
I'm fine! You check him!


00:48:43.854 --> 00:48:46.125
Okay, that's clock.


00:48:47.858 --> 00:48:49.093
Aw...


00:48:49.760 --> 00:48:52.201
Come on, you're standing
like an ape. Come on!


00:48:57.267 --> 00:49:00.471
- Quick on your feet, Sailor!
- Double up the left hand, baby.


00:49:00.971 --> 00:49:03.048
Come on, boy! Hurry up now!


00:49:03.373 --> 00:49:05.018
Double that up, baby.


00:49:13.617 --> 00:49:15.718
That's it. Now, watch out for that.


00:49:15.719 --> 00:49:17.353
Break it up! Break it up!


00:49:17.354 --> 00:49:19.192
Come on, Sailor!


00:49:24.461 --> 00:49:25.761
Come on, King!


00:49:25.762 --> 00:49:27.897
You're getting schooled, Sailor!


00:49:27.898 --> 00:49:30.442
Break it up. Come on, break it up!


00:50:06.269 --> 00:50:07.846
Grab him.


00:50:10.107 --> 00:50:12.150
Come on. Knock him out!


00:50:12.509 --> 00:50:13.909
Let's go home, boy.


00:50:13.910 --> 00:50:16.556
- Break it up, guys.
- Hit him again.


00:50:20.917 --> 00:50:23.723
You got him, King! Take him down!


00:50:30.527 --> 00:50:33.333
Hey, come on, guys. Back
to your corners. Let's go!


00:50:35.766 --> 00:50:37.274
Get going!


00:50:38.969 --> 00:50:41.775
Put him out of his misery!
Come on, King!


00:50:43.540 --> 00:50:46.108
Sit the fuck down. Stop, come here.


00:50:46.109 --> 00:50:48.110
Come on, Sailor! Get the kid!


00:50:48.111 --> 00:50:49.915
Let me have a look at you here.


00:50:51.048 --> 00:50:53.049
You're letting that
old man beat you!


00:50:53.050 --> 00:50:56.288
- Get me a mirror.
- You don't need no mirror. Not now.


00:50:59.489 --> 00:51:03.865
- Send him to his grave!
- Put him in the hospital, King!


00:51:10.133 --> 00:51:11.634
- Hey.
- Hi.


00:51:11.635 --> 00:51:13.135
Are you okay?


00:51:13.136 --> 00:51:16.545
- I couldn't...
- It's okay, I'm a doctor.


00:51:21.011 --> 00:51:22.713
How far?


00:51:25.048 --> 00:51:26.283
Fourth month.


00:51:26.483 --> 00:51:28.350
Okay. We should get
you out of here.


00:51:28.351 --> 00:51:31.720
We need to get you in an ambulance.
Come on. Come with me.


00:51:31.721 --> 00:51:33.025
It's okay. Come on.


00:51:37.127 --> 00:51:40.740
Hey. That old man is messing
you up pretty good.


00:51:41.665 --> 00:51:43.902
You gonna let him
get away with that?


00:51:45.502 --> 00:51:49.672
What you smiling about?
You got nothing to smile about.


00:51:49.673 --> 00:51:51.375
I never liked being pretty.


00:51:52.042 --> 00:51:53.585
You ain't pretty no more.


00:51:54.211 --> 00:51:56.278
Best not to take any chances.


00:51:56.279 --> 00:51:58.647
King Soloman's my baby's daddy.


00:51:58.648 --> 00:52:01.484
- The young guy fighting?
- Yeah.


00:52:01.485 --> 00:52:03.219
We just got married.


00:52:03.220 --> 00:52:06.655
I don't have a ring yet, but he
says he's gonna get me a nice one


00:52:06.656 --> 00:52:09.124
- after he wins the fight.
- Oh, that's good. That's good.


00:52:10.627 --> 00:52:12.094
Why are you here?


00:52:12.095 --> 00:52:14.630
Sailor O'Connor, the guy
your husband's fighting.


00:52:14.631 --> 00:52:17.466
- The old guy.
- Yeah. What's your name?


00:52:17.467 --> 00:52:20.169
- Peg.
- Peg, I'm Diane.


00:52:20.170 --> 00:52:24.113
Mm. You got kids with Sailor?


00:52:24.741 --> 00:52:28.548
They are going crazy
with the presents.


00:52:28.912 --> 00:52:32.525
<i>No. Not with Sailor.</i>


00:52:40.524 --> 00:52:43.392
- Are you the lady that phoned 911?
- Yes.


00:52:43.393 --> 00:52:45.594
- What's the problem?
- Preterm contractions.


00:52:45.595 --> 00:52:48.531
She's in her second trimester.
Do you have a heart monitor?


00:52:48.532 --> 00:52:51.367
- Are you a doctor? Okay.
- Yes.


00:52:51.368 --> 00:52:54.203
You don't need to do this, okay?
There's no need to go on.


00:52:54.204 --> 00:52:57.248
We can end this with dignity.
You understand? With dignity.


00:52:58.108 --> 00:52:59.308
Look.


00:52:59.309 --> 00:53:03.012
<i>Come on, Sailor, come on!
Fight back! Come on! Fight back,</i>


00:53:03.013 --> 00:53:05.147
you little wuss. Come on!


00:53:05.148 --> 00:53:07.487
Come on, come on! Fight back!


00:53:07.918 --> 00:53:09.722
Get up, Sailor.


00:53:10.220 --> 00:53:13.455
Get up, you little wuss, get up!


00:53:13.456 --> 00:53:15.057
Get up.


00:53:15.058 --> 00:53:17.259
Get up!


00:53:17.260 --> 00:53:18.962
Get up!


00:53:20.463 --> 00:53:23.065
You don't need to do this.
There's no need to go on.


00:53:23.066 --> 00:53:26.468
You done yourself real good. You should
be proud. You made me damn proud.


00:53:26.469 --> 00:53:28.037
You're doing great.


00:53:28.038 --> 00:53:30.172
There's no shame in
throwing in the towel.


00:53:30.173 --> 00:53:33.075
You still got the record.
You still haven't gone down.


00:53:33.076 --> 00:53:36.314
- We can... I don't wanna do this.
- We can do this, Mike.


00:53:37.247 --> 00:53:39.815
What for? You still got...
You haven't gone down yet.


00:53:39.816 --> 00:53:41.917
- I ain't going down, Mike.
- Well, if you go down,


00:53:41.918 --> 00:53:43.586
you might not get up, okay?


00:53:43.587 --> 00:53:45.921
And if you go down,
I think I'll kick your ass.


00:53:45.922 --> 00:53:47.389
- All right.
- All right.


00:53:47.390 --> 00:53:48.724
I love you, Mike.


00:53:48.725 --> 00:53:51.594
- I'm telling you, the last one...
- Mike. I love you, Mike.


00:53:51.595 --> 00:53:53.035
I love you too.


00:53:59.102 --> 00:54:00.342
Okay, tough guy.


00:54:08.745 --> 00:54:12.392
Normal sinus rhythm,
hemodynamically stable.


00:54:13.516 --> 00:54:16.652
Peg, if this were me,


00:54:16.653 --> 00:54:20.489
I would go to the hospital just
for some extra testing, okay?


00:54:20.490 --> 00:54:23.933
I'm okay. Really, I'm...


00:54:26.997 --> 00:54:29.837
I gotta see the end of the fight.


00:54:31.134 --> 00:54:33.712
I must say, Rose,


00:54:33.970 --> 00:54:35.871
I'm a tad uncomfortable.


00:54:35.872 --> 00:54:40.643
What? Sitting in the home of a
woman who despises your God?


00:54:40.644 --> 00:54:42.380
I have a crucifix up my arse.


00:54:43.546 --> 00:54:47.455
Those were the conditions under
which you agreed to meet me, hm?


00:54:47.617 --> 00:54:49.551
You know, a man in your profession


00:54:49.552 --> 00:54:52.756
shouldn't joke about having
something up your butt.


00:54:53.823 --> 00:54:55.858
Sorry. Quite right.


00:54:55.859 --> 00:54:57.697
Do you know the old limerick?


00:54:58.395 --> 00:55:00.729
Which limerick would that be?


00:55:00.730 --> 00:55:04.500
<i>The altar boy, the altar boy
The dirty little beast</i>


00:55:04.501 --> 00:55:08.205
<i>He filled his ass with broken glass
And circumcised the priest</i>


00:55:10.774 --> 00:55:15.411
That's a sad commentary on what's
befallen the most noble calling.


00:55:15.412 --> 00:55:17.012
How do you handle such things?


00:55:17.013 --> 00:55:18.480
Such things?


00:55:18.481 --> 00:55:22.384
Well, the spirit is willing,
but the flesh is weak.


00:55:22.385 --> 00:55:26.855
You know, a priest once told me, he
tied his hands up with his rosary


00:55:26.856 --> 00:55:29.091
every night before he went to bed


00:55:29.092 --> 00:55:31.397
so he couldn't masturbate
while sleeping.


00:55:32.429 --> 00:55:35.109
And why did he tell you that?


00:55:35.965 --> 00:55:37.700
I was a young girl at the time.


00:55:37.701 --> 00:55:42.071
- I cut a bit of a skirt, I did in my day.
- No doubt.


00:55:42.072 --> 00:55:45.107
I think he wanted to get
up under that skirt.


00:55:45.108 --> 00:55:48.544
Just wanted to talk sexy
and try and get me going.


00:55:48.545 --> 00:55:50.088
Ah.


00:55:51.881 --> 00:55:57.186
Tell me, you're a relatively
young, seemingly virile man,


00:55:57.187 --> 00:56:00.889
who I'm assuming has all
parts yet fully functioning.


00:56:00.890 --> 00:56:02.758
Yes, as far as I know.


00:56:02.759 --> 00:56:04.526
Oh, mores the pity, then.


00:56:04.527 --> 00:56:07.162
Rose, I'm just a little
embarrassed here.


00:56:07.163 --> 00:56:09.934
- I'm not here to talk about my sex life.
- Ha.


00:56:09.966 --> 00:56:12.578
Well, here's hoping there's
something to talk about.


00:56:13.903 --> 00:56:15.480
Rose,


00:56:15.839 --> 00:56:17.039
um, Sailor's


00:56:17.040 --> 00:56:18.685
quite concerned about you.


00:56:19.275 --> 00:56:21.844
Sailor should be
concerned about himself.


00:56:21.845 --> 00:56:24.113
You know what he's gone
and done, don't you?


00:56:24.114 --> 00:56:26.048
You're talking about the fight.


00:56:26.049 --> 00:56:28.384
- Is that what you're calling it?
- What are you calling it?


00:56:28.385 --> 00:56:31.520
- My son is an old man.
- No, he's not that old.


00:56:31.521 --> 00:56:34.957
- He's...
- No. He's old and you know it.


00:56:34.958 --> 00:56:36.525
This won't be a fight.


00:56:36.526 --> 00:56:39.828
Sure, it will be. He's very
tough, he's in terrific shape.


00:56:39.829 --> 00:56:41.764
You know why he's
taking it, don't you?


00:56:41.765 --> 00:56:47.313
Yes. He wants to take you to
Ireland. One more visit for you.


00:56:48.338 --> 00:56:52.816
That's not it. He may think
that's it, but it's not.


00:56:53.443 --> 00:56:55.122
What do you think the reason is?


00:56:55.945 --> 00:56:57.556
Guilt.


00:56:59.783 --> 00:57:01.326
Guilt?


00:57:02.118 --> 00:57:03.490
About...?


00:57:04.154 --> 00:57:06.391
Being alive.


00:57:25.875 --> 00:57:27.782
Come on, King!


00:57:30.647 --> 00:57:32.793
Finish him off, King!


00:57:34.684 --> 00:57:36.488
Rock the body!


00:57:39.989 --> 00:57:41.356
You can do it!


00:57:41.357 --> 00:57:44.197
Take the old man out, King!


00:57:52.902 --> 00:57:55.082
Break it up, guys.
Break it up. Let's go.


00:57:56.806 --> 00:58:00.351
- Send him to his grave!
- Put him in the hospital, King!


00:58:06.649 --> 00:58:08.294
<i>How much?</i>


00:58:09.586 --> 00:58:14.929
How much wrong can a
person do before...?


00:58:16.826 --> 00:58:21.338
Before they've used up
whatever good is inside them?


00:58:26.769 --> 00:58:28.812
I mean...


00:58:30.406 --> 00:58:32.279
What I did...


00:58:37.413 --> 00:58:39.058
Diane...


00:58:40.016 --> 00:58:41.251
God...


00:58:42.385 --> 00:58:44.720
can be far worse than us.


00:58:44.721 --> 00:58:50.166
He can do more damage, cause
more pain and suffering,


00:58:50.460 --> 00:58:53.795
provide us with more temptation
than anything in the universe


00:58:53.796 --> 00:58:57.299
and yet, we sin,


00:58:57.300 --> 00:58:59.104
and he doesn't.


00:59:00.103 --> 00:59:02.749
I'm not quite sure how that works.


00:59:11.447 --> 00:59:13.718
I have nothing.


00:59:19.455 --> 00:59:22.033
How do I go on?


00:59:23.526 --> 00:59:26.400
You need to learn to surrender.


00:59:30.466 --> 00:59:33.078
You got him, King! Take him down!


00:59:38.441 --> 00:59:41.577
- Jab. Jab him!
- Break it up!


00:59:41.578 --> 00:59:43.312
Break it up, guys. Break it up.


00:59:43.313 --> 00:59:45.033
You got him, Sailor. He's tired!


00:59:45.281 --> 00:59:49.685
Sailor. Sailor, this boxing
is a younger man's sport,


00:59:49.686 --> 00:59:53.021
always has been, and you're not
as young as you used to be.


00:59:53.022 --> 00:59:55.190
Now, you're strong as a bull,


00:59:55.191 --> 00:59:56.592
but if you're taking this


00:59:56.593 --> 00:59:58.827
fight to make the money


00:59:58.828 --> 01:00:02.305
to take Rose to Ireland,
there are other ways.


01:00:02.632 --> 01:00:04.032
Bake sales.


01:00:04.033 --> 01:00:07.369
Yo, old-timer! Hey!


01:00:07.370 --> 01:00:09.550
You know who I am?


01:00:09.939 --> 01:00:13.875
I'm the man who's gonna
knock you the fuck out.


01:00:13.876 --> 01:00:15.919
That's who I am.


01:00:20.316 --> 01:00:23.292
Yeah. I know who you are.


01:00:25.355 --> 01:00:27.456
I hope you punish me.


01:00:27.457 --> 01:00:29.659
I hope you knock me
down, I really do.


01:00:30.193 --> 01:00:32.227
And I hope you


01:00:32.228 --> 01:00:34.601
knock some sense into this old man.


01:00:35.798 --> 01:00:37.204
That would be my wish.


01:00:40.336 --> 01:00:42.209
Let me ask you something.


01:00:42.972 --> 01:00:44.640
Do you have kids?


01:00:44.641 --> 01:00:47.219
- No, you're too young.
- I have one on the way.


01:00:48.778 --> 01:00:52.255
That's a beautiful thing.
It really is. Right, Sean?


01:00:52.548 --> 01:00:54.386
Yes, it is.


01:00:56.252 --> 01:00:57.522
You know,


01:00:58.721 --> 01:01:01.765
I held my son as he
took his final breath.


01:01:02.792 --> 01:01:05.598
I didn't have an answer for him.


01:01:08.564 --> 01:01:13.235
I will do my best, as will you.
Now, get the fuck out of here.


01:01:24.113 --> 01:01:26.088
No, stop!


01:01:42.065 --> 01:01:44.006
You okay?


01:01:51.274 --> 01:01:52.851
How long?


01:02:01.451 --> 01:02:03.426
Five years,


01:02:04.954 --> 01:02:06.497
11 months,


01:02:10.526 --> 01:02:12.933
27 days.


01:02:19.702 --> 01:02:21.381
So...


01:02:22.872 --> 01:02:24.983
how did you come to this?


01:02:25.875 --> 01:02:27.850
Bad relationship?


01:02:30.313 --> 01:02:34.188
Did anyone tell you about the
three rings of a relationship?


01:02:35.118 --> 01:02:40.358
Engagement ring, a wedding
ring and the suffering.


01:02:42.658 --> 01:02:44.337
Sorry.


01:02:45.228 --> 01:02:47.408
Bad joke.


01:02:58.908 --> 01:03:01.281
It's what I did.


01:03:04.847 --> 01:03:06.492
What you did?


01:03:13.356 --> 01:03:17.333
What we do is never really done.


01:03:21.798 --> 01:03:24.376
What you got in that glass,


01:03:24.801 --> 01:03:26.810
it won't help.


01:03:27.603 --> 01:03:29.441
It's not the answer.


01:03:30.373 --> 01:03:32.450
You know that.


01:03:34.777 --> 01:03:37.082
Because we all been there.


01:03:58.935 --> 01:04:00.876
Thank you.


01:04:40.409 --> 01:04:42.145
I, uh...


01:04:43.446 --> 01:04:45.148
I need to talk to you.


01:04:53.389 --> 01:04:55.364
Talk to him.


01:05:00.129 --> 01:05:02.097
Sailor, I...


01:05:02.098 --> 01:05:04.710
- I came here because...
- Diane.


01:05:06.035 --> 01:05:08.181
You were deceitful...


01:05:09.705 --> 01:05:13.011
without the slightest
consideration.


01:05:14.877 --> 01:05:16.750
A mother.


01:05:17.713 --> 01:05:19.290
A monster.


01:05:23.286 --> 01:05:28.367
I'm sorry. I am so, so sorry.


01:05:37.300 --> 01:05:39.480
You knew you were sick.


01:05:40.736 --> 01:05:43.041
Why didn't you seek help?


01:05:47.109 --> 01:05:51.086
Help was around you every day.


01:05:51.948 --> 01:05:53.525
Why?


01:05:54.383 --> 01:05:56.585
Why didn't you seek help?


01:06:08.431 --> 01:06:12.909
And now that you're better,
you want my forgiveness.


01:06:15.771 --> 01:06:17.416
No.


01:06:18.374 --> 01:06:20.781
Diane, Diane.


01:06:21.310 --> 01:06:25.754
Please, get out of here.


01:07:03.052 --> 01:07:09.259
I will spend the rest of my life
trying to make up for what I did,


01:07:10.860 --> 01:07:13.006
for the pain I caused you.


01:07:14.463 --> 01:07:16.768
Caused my family.


01:07:18.501 --> 01:07:21.079
I see the hate in your eyes.


01:07:22.104 --> 01:07:24.215
I deserve it.


01:07:25.207 --> 01:07:29.044
You don't. With each
breath I take, I...


01:07:29.045 --> 01:07:31.657
I hate myself enough
for the both of us.


01:07:38.654 --> 01:07:40.299
I'm not...


01:07:41.357 --> 01:07:44.299
I'm not asking for forgiveness.


01:07:45.261 --> 01:07:49.671
Contrary to the teachings
of your faith, there...


01:07:51.667 --> 01:07:55.212
There are things that
are unforgivable.


01:07:59.041 --> 01:08:02.654
But I will not have
you consumed by hate.


01:08:04.346 --> 01:08:08.383
So you... You pray to your God


01:08:08.384 --> 01:08:13.533
for your loss, for your salvation,


01:08:14.190 --> 01:08:16.131
and for theirs.


01:08:18.260 --> 01:08:22.567
You ask him to help you find
a way out of your hate.


01:08:26.469 --> 01:08:30.674
But don't you ever pray for me.


01:08:33.242 --> 01:08:35.547
I don't deserve it.


01:08:49.692 --> 01:08:53.669
Come on, son. You're gonna be late.


01:08:56.031 --> 01:09:00.034
- Use your jab. Use your jab.
- Break that glass jaw, Sailor.


01:09:00.035 --> 01:09:02.715
Take the old man out, King!


01:09:04.039 --> 01:09:05.240
Kill him, Sailor!


01:09:05.241 --> 01:09:07.114
Don't box if you can't
win a boxing match!


01:09:18.754 --> 01:09:22.123
Pauly. Come on.
We're gonna be late.


01:09:22.124 --> 01:09:24.065
What you got there?


01:09:24.527 --> 01:09:26.861
How about some ice
cream after church?


01:09:26.862 --> 01:09:29.063
Rinse that mug. Rinse it good.


01:09:29.064 --> 01:09:32.268
Sailor, look at me. You okay?


01:09:36.105 --> 01:09:38.615
All right, ladies and gentlemen!


01:09:41.343 --> 01:09:44.046
How are you enjoying
the fight tonight?


01:09:46.549 --> 01:09:50.629
Well, I think these boys have
suffered enough, don't you?


01:09:55.057 --> 01:09:58.893
So, what I'm gonna do is I'm
gonna offer them a new prize.


01:09:58.894 --> 01:10:02.030
- Twelve grand to the loser.
- Boo!


01:10:02.031 --> 01:10:05.166
Two grand more than
the winner's purse.


01:10:05.167 --> 01:10:07.108
What do you say?


01:10:08.037 --> 01:10:09.971
What do you say, Sailor?


01:10:09.972 --> 01:10:11.706
Hey, get him out of the ring!


01:10:11.707 --> 01:10:13.541
Get that piece of
shit out of there!


01:10:13.542 --> 01:10:16.245
That's the biggest
purse of your life.


01:10:16.845 --> 01:10:20.114
All you gotta do is lie down,
and the money's yours.


01:10:20.115 --> 01:10:22.050
Get out of the ring.
Get out of here.


01:10:22.051 --> 01:10:24.619
Sit down, sit down, sit down.
What's wrong with you?


01:10:24.620 --> 01:10:25.787
No! Oh,


01:10:25.788 --> 01:10:27.865
my gosh!


01:10:31.026 --> 01:10:33.467
What about you, King?


01:10:34.029 --> 01:10:36.835
I hear you got a baby coming soon.


01:10:37.466 --> 01:10:40.340
All you gotta do is just lie down.


01:10:41.837 --> 01:10:43.175
Yeah.


01:10:43.505 --> 01:10:46.241
Now I know you are a loser.


01:10:46.242 --> 01:10:49.577
- Twelve thousand dollars to the loser.
- Hey, hey.


01:10:49.578 --> 01:10:52.315
Don't do this, Eddie.
Don't do this.


01:10:52.448 --> 01:10:56.417
Do not do this. Yeah, you wanna
mess up the kid's career, huh?


01:10:56.418 --> 01:10:59.120
You're jealous because
you lost the purse.


01:10:59.121 --> 01:11:01.022
You lost him. You'll
never get him back.


01:11:01.023 --> 01:11:04.292
- Twelve thousand to your loser!
- Get him out of here!


01:11:04.293 --> 01:11:07.372
Get him out of my face!
You're a piece of shit!


01:11:09.398 --> 01:11:12.033
I'm done with you all!
I'm out of here.


01:11:12.034 --> 01:11:13.838
Let's pray.


01:11:14.470 --> 01:11:18.439
Father in heaven, please protect
Brother Sailor tonight.


01:11:18.440 --> 01:11:19.641
- Amen.
- Amen.


01:11:19.642 --> 01:11:23.911
Amen. And protect Brother
King tonight, as well.


01:11:23.912 --> 01:11:25.147
- Amen.
- Amen.


01:11:37.393 --> 01:11:39.231
Hold on for a second.


01:11:45.934 --> 01:11:47.511
Hey.


01:11:50.506 --> 01:11:52.845
Everything's gonna be okay.


01:11:54.276 --> 01:11:56.285
We're a family.


01:12:17.766 --> 01:12:20.268
You go, baby boy.


01:12:20.269 --> 01:12:22.471
You got this fight. You've won it.


01:12:23.138 --> 01:12:26.341
You've won the fight, man.
Don't do anything stupid.


01:12:26.342 --> 01:12:28.613
Gotta knock him down.


01:12:29.378 --> 01:12:32.559
All right. If you want
to knock him down,


01:12:33.182 --> 01:12:35.083
you work on his body.


01:12:35.084 --> 01:12:38.386
God knows what his head is made
of, but it sure ain't skin and bone.


01:12:38.387 --> 01:12:39.587
Gotta knock him down.


01:12:39.588 --> 01:12:42.357
You kill the body
and the head dies.


01:12:42.358 --> 01:12:45.732
You hear me? Kill the body
and the head will die.


01:12:46.061 --> 01:12:48.138
All right.


01:12:51.100 --> 01:12:52.301
- You all right?
- Yeah.


01:13:06.382 --> 01:13:08.152
It's time, kid.


01:13:12.488 --> 01:13:14.031
Hey, hey.


01:13:14.490 --> 01:13:17.671
I want you to know that I'm proud
of what you've become, boy.


01:13:19.862 --> 01:13:21.769
Okay, let's go, guys.


01:13:22.731 --> 01:13:24.410
Sailor.


01:13:25.234 --> 01:13:27.880
That's enough, bud. That's
enough, that's enough.


01:13:37.880 --> 01:13:40.321
You're getting schooled, Sailor!


01:13:45.754 --> 01:13:48.833
Get outside that left foot!
Outside the left foot!


01:13:49.191 --> 01:13:51.166
Put him in the hospital, King!


01:13:53.762 --> 01:13:54.997
Put him down!


01:13:57.499 --> 01:14:00.578
Break it up, guys. Come on.


01:14:41.910 --> 01:14:44.420
- Hey!
- Sailor, I'm sorry.


01:14:45.113 --> 01:14:47.850
- I'm sorry.
- Back to your corner, let's go.


01:14:54.256 --> 01:14:55.690
Hey, you okay?


01:14:55.691 --> 01:14:56.958
I shat myself.


01:14:56.959 --> 01:14:59.264
All right, Sailor,
stay standing. I got it.


01:14:59.962 --> 01:15:02.108
Hey, hey, clean towels, now.


01:15:03.332 --> 01:15:05.478
Hey, look. He lost his mud.


01:15:05.734 --> 01:15:07.607
The Sailor lost his mud, man.


01:15:08.136 --> 01:15:09.604
The Sailor's gonna go down.


01:15:09.605 --> 01:15:12.473
For the first time in history,
that Sailor's gonna go down.


01:15:12.474 --> 01:15:15.343
Now is your shot, man.
Now is your shot.


01:15:15.344 --> 01:15:18.112
You go get him. Get on him.


01:15:18.113 --> 01:15:21.317
- This is your shot. For life.
- Shut up!


01:15:27.322 --> 01:15:29.891
You're doing good, buddy.
It's all over, okay?


01:15:29.892 --> 01:15:31.359
- One more.
- It's all over.


01:15:31.360 --> 01:15:33.427
- One more round.
- Your kidneys are gone.


01:15:33.428 --> 01:15:36.998
What is the matter with you? What
are you, nuts? What's the point?


01:15:36.999 --> 01:15:39.634
You couldn't beat this guy
with a baseball bat, okay?


01:15:39.635 --> 01:15:41.969
You got another L in
the column. Big deal.


01:15:41.970 --> 01:15:45.439
You're still standing, right? You
never been down. What is the point?


01:15:45.440 --> 01:15:48.780
I swore on my ma's head I
would never quit, Mikey.


01:15:49.678 --> 01:15:53.114
- I promised.
- You're good to go, Sailor.


01:15:53.115 --> 01:15:55.116
We'll let the doc decide. You sit.


01:15:55.117 --> 01:15:57.923
Hey, Gordy, you bring
the doc, please?


01:16:02.858 --> 01:16:04.058
Look at me.


01:16:04.059 --> 01:16:05.863
Sailor.


01:16:06.862 --> 01:16:11.670
- Sailor, look at me. You okay?
- I'm good, doc.


01:16:12.601 --> 01:16:15.002
You're taking too many
shots. I'm gonna stop it.


01:16:15.003 --> 01:16:17.638
One more round, doc,
please. One more round.


01:16:17.639 --> 01:16:20.115
Albright, what do you think?


01:16:20.809 --> 01:16:23.216
I got no opinion.


01:16:24.446 --> 01:16:26.785
Last round, doc,
last round, please.


01:16:27.616 --> 01:16:29.796
I hope I don't hate
myself later for this.


01:16:29.952 --> 01:16:33.190
- You won't.
- Ref, watch him close.


01:16:38.594 --> 01:16:40.595
- Knock him on his butt!
- Shut up!


01:16:40.596 --> 01:16:42.463
- You gonna be famous, man.
- Shut up!


01:16:42.464 --> 01:16:44.832
- What do you mean, shut up?
- Shut up!


01:16:44.833 --> 01:16:47.668
This is your turn, man.
I don't care what you say,


01:16:47.669 --> 01:16:51.783
you get your butt up there
and put the Sailor down!


01:16:52.708 --> 01:16:56.321
All right, Sailor. All right.


01:17:23.505 --> 01:17:24.843
I'm gonna be okay, Mike.


01:17:26.108 --> 01:17:28.015
I promise.


01:17:28.910 --> 01:17:32.182
I promise. I love you.


01:17:35.283 --> 01:17:37.585
Last round! Last round.


01:17:37.586 --> 01:17:39.020
- Come on.
- Come on, guys.


01:17:39.021 --> 01:17:41.929
- Seconds out.
- Let's go home!


01:17:45.761 --> 01:17:48.134
Get outside that left foot.


01:17:50.732 --> 01:17:52.700
Use your jab, use your jab!


01:17:52.701 --> 01:17:54.869
Last round, guys, let's go. Box!


01:17:54.870 --> 01:17:57.516
Come on, old man!


01:17:58.340 --> 01:18:00.741
One punch, Sailor!
Come on, bud, one punch!


01:18:00.742 --> 01:18:02.977
Quick on your feet, Sailor!


01:18:02.978 --> 01:18:06.318
Stay on his right shoulder!
Stay on his right shoulder!


01:18:07.916 --> 01:18:09.720
You're getting schooled, Sailor!


01:18:13.789 --> 01:18:15.423
Break it up.


01:18:15.424 --> 01:18:17.626
Break it up, boy! Break it up!


01:18:27.969 --> 01:18:30.945
- Double that up, baby.
- Get away from him.


01:19:18.053 --> 01:19:20.893
Sailor, grab him! Grab him!


01:19:33.034 --> 01:19:34.304
Give me the towel.


01:19:36.104 --> 01:19:38.648
Put him down! Put him down!


01:19:39.241 --> 01:19:41.443
Oh!


01:19:44.646 --> 01:19:46.553
Do it, kid. Do it.


01:19:49.851 --> 01:19:52.292
Oh!


01:20:01.163 --> 01:20:03.036
Okay, let's go.


01:20:10.272 --> 01:20:12.884
Take the old man out, King!


01:20:13.008 --> 01:20:14.619
Let him go, King.


01:20:16.344 --> 01:20:17.579
Let him go, man.


01:20:18.914 --> 01:20:21.185
Ref, leave him alone!
Leave him alone!


01:20:21.917 --> 01:20:24.752
- I got you.
- He's taking him to the bell.


01:20:24.753 --> 01:20:26.091
We got this.


01:20:26.788 --> 01:20:28.899
Let him go. Drop him.


01:20:48.944 --> 01:20:51.912
<i>Ladies and gentlemen!</i>


01:20:51.913 --> 01:20:54.719
<i>It's a unanimous decision.</i>


01:20:55.217 --> 01:20:58.728
The winner is King Soloman!


01:21:15.136 --> 01:21:17.179
I'm proud of you. Good fight.


01:21:19.241 --> 01:21:21.352
You're a good kid.


01:21:30.819 --> 01:21:33.621
You know what? You're the
toughest son of a bitch I know.


01:21:33.622 --> 01:21:34.822
Thank you.


01:21:34.823 --> 01:21:37.867
Yeah, you're also the dumbest
son of a bitch I know.


01:21:48.670 --> 01:21:50.144
Go see your girl.


01:21:58.747 --> 01:22:00.756
I love you.


01:22:43.058 --> 01:22:44.464
The...


01:22:50.665 --> 01:22:53.038
The best we can do...


01:22:59.074 --> 01:23:01.880
is to forgive ourselves.


01:23:08.049 --> 01:23:09.819
Diane.


01:23:12.520 --> 01:23:14.791
You're not alone.
